
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nandu & Aparna | Wedding Invitation</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f5ef">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --cream: #f8f5ef;
  --green: #647563;
  --gold: #b49a68;
  --ink: #33372f;
  --muted: #77766e;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 300;
}
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
nav {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 22px 7%;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e0d4;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}
.brand { color: var(--green); font-size: 18px; }
.nav-link { color: var(--muted); }
.hero {
  min-height: 88vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 65px 20px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(#f8f5efc9,#f8f5efc9),
    url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85') center/cover;
}
.eyebrow {
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--green);
}
h1, h2, .names {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-weight: 400;
}
h1 {
  font-size: clamp(55px, 10vw, 105px);
  line-height: .95;
  margin: 28px 0;
}
.amp { color: var(--gold); font-style: italic; }
.hero p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.9; }
.date-line {
  margin-top: 35px;
  color: var(--green);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.button {
  display: inline-block;
  border: 1px solid var(--green);
  padding: 14px 25px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.button:hover { background: #4e604e; }
section { padding: 90px 7%; text-align: center; }
.section-label {
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
h2 { font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 58px); margin: 15px 0 25px; }
.intro { max-width: 520px; margin: auto; line-height: 2; color: var(--muted); }
.details {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
  gap: 25px;
  max-width: 950px;
  margin: 55px auto 0;
}
.detail {
  padding: 30px 15px;
  border-top: 1px solid #d9cfbc;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #d9cfbc;
}
.detail h3 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 27px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--green);
}
.detail p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--muted); }
.gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
  gap: 14px;
  max-width: 1050px;
  margin: 40px auto 0;
}
.gallery img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 300px;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.gallery img:nth-child(2) { margin-top: 25px; }
#rsvp { background: #eeebe3; }
form { max-width: 500px; margin: 35px auto 0; text-align: left; }
label { display: block; font-size: 12px; margin: 18px 0 8px; }
input, select, textarea {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 14px;
  border: 1px solid #d8d0c2;
  background: #faf8f3;
  font: inherit;
  color: var(--ink);
  border-radius: 0;
}
textarea { min-height: 90px; resize: vertical; }
form .button { width: 100%; }
#response { text-align: center; color: var(--green); margin-top: 18px; }
.map-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 12px; }
footer {
  padding: 45px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--muted);
}
footer strong {
  display: block;
  font: 32px 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  color: var(--green);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
@media(max-width:650px) {
  nav { padding: 18px 5%; }
  .nav-link { letter-spacing: 0; }
  .hero { min-height: 78vh; }
  section { padding: 65px 6%; }
  .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; margin-top: 30px; }
  .detail { padding: 15px; }
  .gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 9px; }
  .gallery img { height: 200px; }
  .gallery img:nth-child(2) { margin-top: 0; }
  .gallery img:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; height: 240px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a class="brand" href="#">N & A</a>
  <a class="nav-link" href="#rsvp">KINDLY RSVP ↗</a>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Together with their families</div>
    <h1>Nandu <span class="amp">&</span><br>Aparna</h1>
    <p>Joyfully invite you to celebrate<br>
       the beginning of their forever.</p>
    <div class="date-line">OUR WEDDING · YOUR BLESSINGS</div>
    <a class="button" href="#details">EXPLORE OUR INVITATION</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="details">
  <div class="section-label">A beautiful beginning</div>
  <h2>Save the Date</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    With love in our hearts and blessings from our families,
    we would be delighted to have you with us as we begin
    this beautiful new chapter together.
  </p>

  <div class="details">
    <div class="detail">
      <div class="section-label">When</div>
      <h3>[Wedding Date]</h3>
      <p>[Day of the week]<br>[Time]</p>
    </div>
    <div class="detail">
      <div class="section-label">Where</div>
      <h3>[Venue Name]</h3>
      <p>[Town / City]<br>[Full venue address]</p>
    </div>
    <div class="detail">
      <div class="section-label">Celebration</div>
      <h3>Our Forever</h3>
      <p>A day of love, laughter,<br>and cherished memories.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a class="button" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=YOUR+VENUE"
     target="_blank" rel="noopener">OPEN VENUE MAP ↗</a>
  <p class="map-note">Replace the sample map link with your actual venue location.</p>
</section>

<section id="gallery">
  <div class="section-label">Little moments, big love</div>
  <h2>Our Gallery</h2>
  <p class="intro">A few beautiful frames from our journey.</p>
  <div class="gallery">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537633552985-df8429e8048b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Wedding couple">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511285560929-80b456fea0bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Wedding celebration">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523438885200-e635ba2c371e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Wedding details">
  </div>
  <p class="map-note">Replace these sample photos with your own favourite pictures.</p>
</section>

<section id="rsvp">
  <div class="section-label">We hope you can join us</div>
  <h2>Kindly RSVP</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    Your presence will make our day even more special.
    Please let us know if you can celebrate with us.
  </p>

  <form id="rsvpForm">
    <label for="guest">Your full name</label>
    <input id="guest" name="guest" required placeholder="Enter your name">

    <label for="attendance">Will you be joining us?</label>
    <select id="attendance" name="attendance" required>
      <option value="">Please select</option>
      <option value="Joyfully accepts">Joyfully accepts</option>
      <option value="Regretfully declines">Regretfully declines</option>
    </select>

    <label for="guests">Number of guests</label>
    <select id="guests" name="guests">
      <option value="1">1 guest</option>
      <option value="2">2 guests</option>
      <option value="3">3 guests</option>
      <option value="4">4 guests</option>
      <option value="5+">5 or more guests</option>
    </select>

    <label for="message">A little note for us (optional)</label>
    <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Your wishes for the couple..."></textarea>

    <button class="button" type="submit">SEND RSVP ♡</button>
    <p id="response" role="status"></p>
  </form>
</section>

<footer>
  <strong>Nandu & Aparna</strong>
  Made with love, for a day to remember.
  <p>[Wedding Date] · [Wedding Venue]</p>
</footer>

<script>
document.getElementById('rsvpForm').addEventListener('submit', function(event) {
  event.preventDefault();

  const guest = document.getElementById('guest').value.trim();
  const attendance = document.getElementById('attendance').value;

  if (!guest || !attendance) return;

  document.getElementById('response').textContent =
    'Thank you, ' + guest + '! Your response has been noted on this device. ♡';

  // Demo only: this form does not send or save responses online.
  // Connect a form backend to collect RSVPs from your guests.
});
</script>

</body>
</html>
